      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The depot witnessed both the Civil War and the rise of railroads, marking it as a pivotal point in rural Virginia’s growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
